<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sv">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Repaso: Hablar de mí y de otra persona - Spanska 2</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Canvas Confetti CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/canvas-confetti@1.6.0/dist/confetti.browser.min.js"></script>
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            background: #0f172a;
            color: #f8fafc;
        }

        /* Regnbågstext-animation */
        .rainbow-text {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff007f, #ff7300, #ffeb00, #00e676, #00b0ff, #7c4dff, #ff007f);
            background-size: 300% 100%;
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            animation: rainbow-shift 6s linear infinite;
        }

        /* Regnbågs-border animation */
        .rainbow-border-glow {
            position: relative;
            background: #1e293b;
            border-radius: 1.25rem;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        .rainbow-border-glow::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: -3px;
            border-radius: 1.35rem;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #ff007f, #ff7300, #ffeb00, #00e676, #00b0ff, #7c4dff, #ff007f);
            background-size: 400% 400%;
            z-index: -1;
            animation: rainbow-shift 8s ease infinite;
            filter: blur(8px);
            opacity: 0.7;
        }

        /* Progressbar regnbåge */
        .rainbow-bar {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff007f, #ff7300, #ffeb00, #00e676, #00b0ff, #7c4dff);
            background-size: 200% 100%;
            animation: rainbow-shift 3s linear infinite;
        }

        @keyframes rainbow-shift {
            0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
            50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
            100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
        }

        /* Task Cards */
        .task-card {
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.7);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        }
        .task-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.01);
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        /* Pop-up effekt vid klarad uppgift */
        @keyframes popSuccess {
            0% { transform: scale(0.8); opacity: 0; }
            50% { transform: scale(1.08); }
            100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
        }
        .pop-in {
            animation: popSuccess 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275) forwards;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen pb-16">

    <!-- TOP BAR / HEADER -->
    <header class="border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/80 backdrop-blur-md sticky top-0 z-30">
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-pink-500 via-purple-500 to-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-black text-xl shadow-lg">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="rainbow-text">Todo sobre mí y más</span>
                    </h1>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs font-semibold">Spanska 2 – Interaktiv Utmaning</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Profil & Kontroller -->
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="relative">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-user absolute left-3 top-2.5 text-slate-400 text-xs"></i>
                    <input type="text" id="studentName" placeholder="Ditt namn..." class="bg-slate-800 text-slate-100 text-xs font-bold pl-8 pr-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 focus:border-cyan-400 outline-none transition" oninput="saveName()">
                </div>
                <button onclick="resetProgress()" class="text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-rose-950 hover:text-rose-400 text-slate-400 border border-slate-700 hover:border-rose-800 px-3 py-2 rounded-xl font-bold transition flex items-center gap-1.5" title="Nollställ poäng">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-left"></i> Nollställ
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 mt-8">

        <!-- PROGRESS & POÄNGBAR -->
        <section class="rainbow-border-glow p-6 mb-10 shadow-2xl">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-3">
                <div>
                    <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400">Total Progress</span>
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-white flex items-baseline gap-2 mt-0.5">
                        <span id="scoreText" class="rainbow-text text-4xl">0</span>
                        <span class="text-slate-400 text-lg font-bold">/ 100 p</span>
                    </h2>
                </div>
                <div id="badgeContainer" class="text-right">
                    <span id="statusBadge" class="bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700 text-xs font-bold px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full flex items-center gap-2 shadow-inner">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-hourglass-start text-amber-400"></i> Börja samla poäng!
                    </span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Rainbow Progress bar -->
            <div class="w-full bg-slate-950/80 rounded-full h-5 p-1 border border-slate-800 shadow-inner overflow-hidden">
                <div id="progressBar" class="rainbow-bar h-full w-0 rounded-full transition-all duration-700 ease-out shadow-lg"></div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-3 font-medium flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info text-cyan-400"></i> Samla minst <b>100 poäng</b> för att låsa upp slutmålet och vinna!
            </p>
        </section>

        <!-- DASHBOARD UPPGIFTER -->
        <div class="space-y-10">

            <!-- 🟢 GRÖNA RÄTTER -->
            <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-4">
                    <span class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(52,211,153,0.8)]"></span>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-100 tracking-wide">Gröna Rätter <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-normal ml-2">(Låg energi • Ord, fraser, adjektiv & verb)</span></h3>
                </div>
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4" id="greenTasks"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- 🟡 GULA RÄTTER -->
            <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-4">
                    <span class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400 shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(251,191,36,0.8)]"></span>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-100 tracking-wide">Gula Rätter <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-normal ml-2">(Medelenergi • Skriva texter & grammatik)</span></h3>
                </div>
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4" id="yellowTasks"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- 🔴 RÖDA RÄTTER -->
            <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-4">
                    <span class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500 shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(244,63,94,0.8)]"></span>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-100 tracking-wide">Röda Rätter <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-normal ml-2">(Hög energi • Djupgående text, intervju & affisch)</span></h3>
                </div>
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4" id="redTasks"></div>
            </div>

        </div>

    </main>

    <!-- INTERAKTIV MODAL FÖR ÖVNINGAR -->
    <div id="exerciseModal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-md z-50 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <div class="bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl max-w-xl w-full max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto shadow-2xl border border-slate-700 flex flex-col pop-in">
            <!-- Modal Header -->
            <div class="p-5 border-b border-slate-800 flex justify-between items-center bg-slate-900/90 sticky top-0 z-10">
                <div>
                    <span id="modalCategory" class="text-xs font-black px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider"></span>
                    <h2 id="modalTitle" class="text-xl font-extrabold text-white mt-1"></h2>
                </div>
                <button onclick="closeModal()" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-400 hover:text-white flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-bold transition">&times;</button>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Modal Content Body -->
            <div id="modalBody" class="p-6 flex-1 space-y-4 text-slate-200">
                <!-- Dynamiskt innehåll -->
            </div>

            <!-- Modal Footer -->
            <div class="p-4 border-t border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/90 flex justify-end gap-3 sticky bottom-0 z-10">
                <button onclick="closeModal()" class="px-5 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-800 hover:text-white rounded-xl transition">Stäng</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        // WEB AUDIO API - TONE GENERATOR FÖR LJUDEFFEKTER
        const audioCtx = new (window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext)();

        function playSuccessSound() {
            if (audioCtx.state === 'suspended') {
                audioCtx.resume();
            }
            const now = audioCtx.currentTime;
            
            // Ljudackord: C5 -> E5 -> G5 -> C6 (Segeffekt)
            const freqs = [523.25, 659.25, 783.99, 1046.50];
            freqs.forEach((freq, idx) => {
                const osc = audioCtx.createOscillator();
                const gain = audioCtx.createGain();
                
                osc.type = 'triangle';
                osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(freq, now + idx * 0.08);
                
                gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.15, now + idx * 0.08);
                gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.001, now + idx * 0.08 + 0.35);
                
                osc.connect(gain);
                gain.connect(audioCtx.destination);
                
                osc.start(now + idx * 0.08);
                osc.stop(now + idx * 0.08 + 0.35);
            });
        }

        function playErrorSound() {
            if (audioCtx.state === 'suspended') {
                audioCtx.resume();
            }
            const now = audioCtx.currentTime;
            const osc = audioCtx.createOscillator();
            const gain = audioCtx.createGain();
            
            osc.type = 'sawtooth';
            osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(180, now);
            osc.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(110, now + 0.25);
            
            gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.2, now);
            gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.01, now + 0.25);
            
            osc.connect(gain);
            gain.connect(audioCtx.destination);
            
            osc.start(now);
            osc.stop(now + 0.25);
        }

        // TOTAL BLOCKERING AV INKLISTRING
        document.addEventListener('paste', (e) => {
            e.preventDefault();
            alert('Det är inte tillåtet att klistra in text! Du måste skriva dina svar själv.');
        }, true);

        const STORAGE_KEY = 'es_repaso_rainbow_v1';

        const tasks = [
            { id: 'task1', color: 'green', points: 10, title: '1. Fasta vardagsuttryck', desc: 'Koppla samman 8 spanska uttryck med svensk översättning.', type: 'quiz_phrases' },
            { id: 'task2', color: 'green', points: 10, title: '2. Minikorsord: Adjektiv', desc: 'Lös korsordet med 5 viktiga adjektiv.', type: 'crossword_adj' },
            { id: 'task3', color: 'green', points: 15, title: '3. Verb i presens', desc: 'Böj verben ser, tener, vivir och llamarse.', type: 'quiz_verbs' },
            { id: 'task4', color: 'yellow', points: 20, title: '4. Texto: "Todo sobre mí"', desc: 'Skriv en kortare presentation om dig själv.', type: 'write_self' },
            { id: 'task5', color: 'yellow', points: 25, title: '5. Texto: "Mi persona favorita"', desc: 'Beskriv en vän eller kändis i 3:e person.', type: 'write_other' },
            { id: 'task6', color: 'yellow', points: 20, title: '6. Textdetektiven (Fritext)', desc: 'Skriv om de felaktiga meningarna helt korrekt.', type: 'error_detective' },
            { id: 'task7', color: 'yellow', points: 20, title: '7. Ser, Estar o Tener', desc: 'Välj och skriv rätt verbform utifrån kontext.', type: 'ser_estar_tener' },
            { id: 'task8', color: 'red', points: 30, title: '8. Kompisintervjun (Skriv själv)', desc: 'Skriv dina egna meingssvar i intervjuchatten.', type: 'chat_sim' },
            { id: 'task9', color: 'red', points: 30, title: '9. Jämförande affisch', desc: 'Skriv manuset till en affisch om dig och en vän.', type: 'poster_builder' },
            { id: 'task10', color: 'red', points: 30, title: '10. Presentar a una celebridad', desc: 'Skriv en utförlig kändispresentation på spanska.', type: 'write_celebrity' },
            { id: 'task11', color: 'red', points: 40, title: '11. Gran presentación personal (250 ord)', desc: 'Skriv en djupgående presentation om dig själv.', type: 'write_self_long' }
        ];

        let state = { points: 0, completed: {}, studentName: '' };

        window.onload = () => { loadState(); renderTasks(); updateUI(); };

        function loadState() {
            const saved = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY);
            if (saved) {
                try {
                    state = JSON.parse(saved);
                    document.getElementById('studentName').value = state.studentName || '';
                } catch (e) {
                    state = { points: 0, completed: {}, studentName: '' };
                }
            } else {
                state = { points: 0, completed: {}, studentName: '' };
            }
        }

        function saveState() {
            localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, JSON.stringify(state));
        }

        function saveName() {
            state.studentName = document.getElementById('studentName').value;
            saveState();
        }

        function resetProgress() {
            if (confirm("Vill du nollställa alla dina poäng och återställa alla uppgifter?")) {
                state = { points: 0, completed: {}, studentName: state.studentName || '' };
                saveState();
                renderTasks();
                updateUI();
            }
        }

        function updateUI() {
            document.getElementById('scoreText').innerText = state.points;
            const percentage = Math.min(100, (state.points / 100) * 100);
            document.getElementById('progressBar').style.width = percentage + '%';

            const badge = document.getElementById('statusBadge');
            if (state.points >= 100) {
                badge.className = "bg-emerald-950/80 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-600 text-xs font-black px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full flex items-center gap-2 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(16,185,129,0.3)]";
                badge.innerHTML = `<i class="fa-solid fa-trophy text-amber-400"></i> Repetition klar! Mästare!`;
            } else if (state.points >= 50) {
                badge.className = "bg-cyan-950/80 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-600 text-xs font-black px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full flex items-center gap-2";
                badge.innerHTML = `<i class="fa-solid fa-fire text-amber-400"></i> Över hälften klarad!`;
            } else {
                badge.className = "bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700 text-xs font-bold px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full flex items-center gap-2";
                badge.innerHTML = `<i class="fa-solid fa-hourglass-start text-amber-400"></i> Börja samla poäng!`;
            }
        }

        function renderTasks() {
            const greenContainer = document.getElementById('greenTasks');
            const yellowContainer = document.getElementById('yellowTasks');
            const redContainer = document.getElementById('redTasks');

            greenContainer.innerHTML = ''; yellowContainer.innerHTML = ''; redContainer.innerHTML = '';

            tasks.forEach(task => {
                const isDone = !!state.completed[task.id];
                const card = document.createElement('div');
                card.className = `task-card p-5 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between ${isDone ? 'border-emerald-500/50 bg-emerald-950/20' : ''}`;
                
                let badgeColor = task.color === 'green' ? 'bg-emerald-950 text-emerald-400 border-emerald-800' : task.color === 'yellow' ? 'bg-amber-950 text-amber-400 border-amber-800' : 'bg-rose-950 text-rose-400 border-rose-800';

                card.innerHTML = `
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-3">
                            <span class="${badgeColor} text-[11px] font-black px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-lg border">+${task.points} p</span>
                            ${isDone ? '<span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Klar</span>' : ''}
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-base mb-1">${task.title}</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">${task.desc}</p>
                    </div>
                    <button onclick="openTask('${task.id}')" class="w-full text-center py-2.5 px-3 text-xs font-bold rounded-xl transition ${isDone ? 'bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300' : 'bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-blue-600 hover:from-cyan-400 hover:to-blue-500 text-white shadow-lg shadow-cyan-500/20'}">
                        ${isDone ? 'Gör om uppgift' : 'Starta uppgift'}
                    </button>
                `;

                if (task.color === 'green') greenContainer.appendChild(card);
                if (task.color === 'yellow') yellowContainer.appendChild(card);
                if (task.color === 'red') redContainer.appendChild(card);
            });
        }

        function openTask(taskId) {
            const task = tasks.find(t => t.id === taskId);
            if (!task) return;

            document.getElementById('modalTitle').innerText = task.title;
            const catBadge = document.getElementById('modalCategory');
            catBadge.innerText = `+${task.points} Poäng`;
            catBadge.className = `text-xs font-black px-3 py-1 rounded-full ${task.color === 'green' ? 'bg-emerald-950 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-800' : task.color === 'yellow' ? 'bg-amber-950 text-amber-400 border border-amber-800' : 'bg-rose-950 text-rose-400 border border-rose-800'}`;

            const modalBody = document.getElementById('modalBody');
            modalBody.innerHTML = '';

            switch(task.type) {
                case 'quiz_phrases': renderPhrasesQuiz(modalBody, task); break;
                case 'crossword_adj': renderCrossword(modalBody, task); break;
                case 'quiz_verbs': renderVerbsQuiz(modalBody, task); break;
                case 'write_self': renderWriteSelf(modalBody, task); break;
                case 'write_other': renderWriteOther(modalBody, task); break;
                case 'error_detective': renderErrorDetective(modalBody, task); break;
                case 'ser_estar_tener': renderSerEstarTener(modalBody, task); break;
                case 'chat_sim': renderChatSim(modalBody, task); break;
                case 'poster_builder': renderPosterBuilder(modalBody, task); break;
                case 'write_celebrity': renderWriteCelebrity(modalBody, task); break;
                case 'write_self_long': renderWriteSelfLong(modalBody, task); break;
            }

            document.getElementById('exerciseModal').classList.remove('hidden');
        }

        function closeModal() { document.getElementById('exerciseModal').classList.add('hidden'); }

        function completeTask(taskId, points) {
            const isFirstTime = !state.completed[taskId];
            if (isFirstTime) {
                state.points += points;
                state.completed[taskId] = true;
                saveState();
                updateUI();
                renderTasks();
                
                // Spela segerljud och kör regnbågskonfetti!
                playSuccessSound();
                
                confetti({
                    particleCount: 120,
                    spread: 80,
                    origin: { y: 0.6 },
                    colors: ['#ff007f', '#ff7300', '#ffeb00', '#00e676', '#00b0ff', '#7c4dff']
                });
            }
            closeModal();
        }

        function triggerErrorFeedback(elementId, message) {
            playErrorSound();
            const res = document.getElementById(elementId);
            res.innerText = message;
            res.classList.remove('hidden');
        }

        // 1. Fasta vardagsuttryck
        function renderPhrasesQuiz(container, task) {
            container.innerHTML = `
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-3">Koppla ihop rätt spansk vardagsfras med svensk översättning:</p>
                <div class="space-y-2 text-xs">
                    <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-700/60 flex justify-between items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="font-bold text-slate-200">1. ¿Qué tal?</span>
                        <select id="pq1" class="p-1.5 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg text-xs text-slate-200"><option value="">Välj...</option><option value="correct">Hur mår du / Hur är läget?</option><option value="w1">Var bor du?</option><option value="w2">Vad heter du?</option></select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-700/60 flex justify-between items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="font-bold text-slate-200">2. Por favor</span>
                        <select id="pq2" class="p-1.5 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg text-xs text-slate-200"><option value="">Välj...</option><option value="correct">Snälla / Tack (när man ber om något)</option><option value="w1">Tack så mycket</option><option value="w2">God natt</option></select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-700/60 flex justify-between items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="font-bold text-slate-200">3. De nada</span>
                        <select id="pq3" class="p-1.5 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg text-xs text-slate-200"><option value="">Välj...</option><option value="correct">Ingen fara / För all del</option><option value="w1">Ingenting alls</option><option value="w2">Vi ses imorgon</option></select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-700/60 flex justify-between items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="font-bold text-slate-200">4. ¿De dónde eres?</span>
                        <select id="pq4" class="p-1.5 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg text-xs text-slate-200"><option value="">Välj...</option><option value="correct">Varifrån är du?</option><option value="w1">Hur gammal är du?</option><option value="w2">Var jobbar du?</option></select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-700/60 flex justify-between items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="font-bold text-slate-200">5. Hasta luego</span>
                        <select id="pq5" class="p-1.5 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg text-xs text-slate-200"><option value="">Välj...</option><option value="correct">Vi ses senare</option><option value="w1">Tillsammans</option><option value="w2">Trevlig helg</option></select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-700/60 flex justify-between items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="font-bold text-slate-200">6. ¿A qué te dedicas?</span>
                        <select id="pq6" class="p-1.5 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg text-xs text-slate-200"><option value="">Välj...</option><option value="correct">Vad sysslar/jobbar du med?</option><option value="w1">Var bor du?</option><option value="w2">Vilket språk talar du?</option></select>
                    </div>
